The ANGEL-F5 probe is powered by Radioisotope Thermoelectric Generators
and a support battery.

Enable telemetry on datalines 1 and 2 to receive data on those devices.
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Use ODAT instruction to open data lines,
place a line number on stack first:
    02
    ODAT
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
01
ODAT -- enable RTGs telemetry
02
ODAT -- enable the battery telemetry

